/-!
# `Ct`: constant-time proofs for the Aeneas translation of the SLH-DSA crate

* `Ct/Leak.lean`     the leakage monad `Leak α = Result (α × Trace)`, events, `cond`, `loop`,
                     erasure, `erase_loop`.
* `Ct/Do.lean`       `do` notation for `Leak` (Aeneas's elaborator with `Leak.bind`/`Leak.cond`).
* `Ct/Model.lean`    the leakage model: the names of the generated text redefined in
                     `namespace slhdsa_leak` as instrumented primitives (trusted table).
* `Ct/Funs.lean`     GENERATED by `scripts/ct-gen.sh` from `Slhdsa/Funs.lean` (header only).
* `Ct/Check.lean`    checker: constants of the instrumented definitions ⊆ model ∪ whitelist.
* `Ct/CheckTest.lean` name-resolution checks and positive controls for the checker.
* `Ct/Erase.lean`    `slhdsa_leak.f.erase_eq` for all 172 definitions of `Slhdsa/Funs.lean`.
* `Ct/Rel.lean`      the relational judgment `Rel` (and `RelIf` for public outputs) and rules.
* `Ct/Tactic.lean`   `ct_step`/`ct_steps` lockstep tactic.
* `Ct/Sha256.lean`   constant-time lemmas for `sha256.rs`.
* `Ct/Hash.lean`     the first lemmas of `hash.rs` (started only).
-/
